WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.725
Let’s walk through Complete the operator loop.

00:00:02.725 --> 00:00:06.250
Before handoff or export, reconcile shared state, every

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:10.500
pending queue, participant access, specialist outputs, communications

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.325
, and timeline evidence.

00:00:12.325 --> 00:00:16.038
Record unresolved work explicitly rather than inferring completion from an

00:00:16.038 --> 00:00:17.512
empty-looking view.

00:00:17.512 --> 00:00:20.512
On this slide, before handoff or export, reconcile

00:00:20.512 --> 00:00:23.837
the live tracker, pending queues, participant state,

00:00:23.837 --> 00:00:26.188
specialist outputs, and timeline.

00:00:26.735 --> 00:00:29.960
In practice, white Cell owns explicit control and review

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:30.847
decisions;

00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:32.773
specialist seats own their approvals;

00:00:32.773 --> 00:00:36.597
Game Master owns session administration and evidence export.

00:00:36.597 --> 00:00:39.310
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.885
Do not infer completion from visibility.

00:00:41.885 --> 00:00:44.560
Leave actionable notes when returning work.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.960
Start Here remains available above the session label.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:51.560
Use the highlighted Session reference area as your visual reference

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.235
while you complete this check.
